.TH AUDIO_MUSIC 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_music \- Loop s as the music track at gain, replacing any current music
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "void audio_music(const Sound *s, float gain);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loop s as the music track at gain, replacing any current music. s must outlive the playback: keep it in a static and stop the music before freeing it. Restarts from the beginning; there is no crossfade, so a level with the same track as the previous one should not call it again. Loops seamlessly if the file loops cleanly.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audio_music_stop (3),
.BR audio_free (3),
.BR audio_set_master (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
